WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.440
Our home is part of this forest. We tend established fields in cycles.

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.849
We grow rice for a season, then rest the field for years. Plants return while we farm another plot.

3
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:21.300
Today we prepare a rice field together. Ash from plant residues returns some nutrients to the soil.

4
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:30.820
Before lighting, clear leaves and branches to bare soil. The firebreak interrupts fuel between field and forest.

5
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:38.100
Embers can still fly across. Read the wind. Let your team help watch the forest edge.

6
00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:43.870
The flames are gone. The ash is still hot. Douse the remaining embers.

7
00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:52.870
In this game, the satellite scans each evening. It sees hot spots, but not the lives beneath them.

8
00:00:53.750 --> 00:01:02.991
Prepare the boundary. Control the fire. Cool the embers. Leave enough cooled ash, and no hot spots before the evening scan.

